{
    "description": "One SNS message body of every kind the asset and file indexer topics carry, as the publishers send them: snsQueuing relays each DynamoDB stream record (without its OldImage on INSERT and MODIFY), sqsBucketSync publishes the SQS-wrapped S3 event with the bucket identity. Key schemas are the tables' in storageBuilder-nestedStack.ts. `topics` names the topics a message is published to and whether the compliance trigger queue's subscription on that topic must admit or drop it: every message reaches the queue exactly once. The backend test test_complianceTrigger_topicSamples.py holds these bodies to the relay's output and the trigger's routing.",
